    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2897260/extras/23342fb83d87597c9999eff74500a882.poster.avif?t=1741555589\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2897260/extras/23342fb83d87597c9999eff74500a882.webm?t=1741555589\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2897260/extras/23342fb83d87597c9999eff74500a882.mp4?t=1741555589\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Embark on a perilous journey to the Forsaken Isles, a land that once brimmed with life and now echoes the tales of its fall. Amidst the chaos, a lone wizard rises against the tide of darkness, powered by the mystical Heart of the Isles. Join the fight in this enthralling top-down, twin-stick tower defense adventure, where survival is just the beginning.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2897260/extras/e5efa0e39ee064079c216bc77edf27ee.poster.avif?t=1741555589\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2897260/extras/e5efa0e39ee064079c216bc77edf27ee.webm?t=1741555589\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2897260/extras/e5efa0e39ee064079c216bc77edf27ee.mp4?t=1741555589\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2897260/extras/ba9ac69e2c8e1b981e9771bb0002096d.poster.avif?t=1741555589\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2897260/extras/ba9ac69e2c8e1b981e9771bb0002096d.webm?t=1741555589\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2897260/extras/ba9ac69e2c8e1b981e9771bb0002096d.mp4?t=1741555589\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>A Land of Beauty and Despair</strong><br>Imagine a paradise lost, the Forsaken Isles await you with open arms and hidden dangers. Once a haven of tranquility, now a battlefield where only the brave dare to tread. As a vacation spot, it's... unconventional. But for a hero like you? It's perfect.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2897260/extras/e52d9ac16786850dfc745a99afad5e7f.poster.avif?t=1741555589\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2897260/extras/e52d9ac16786850dfc745a99afad5e7f.webm?t=1741555589\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2897260/extras/e52d9ac16786850dfc745a99afad5e7f.mp4?t=1741555589\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Intense Combat and Strategic Defense</strong><br>Inspired by the wave-based excitement of Plants vs Zombies and the addictive leveling system of Vampire Survivors, Paradise Defense Force offers a unique blend of action and strategy. Face hordes of enemies, each wave more challenging than the last, and stand your ground with cunning defenses and powerful spells.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2897260/extras/78a5d377e5d6a491ca8dd6374fb40253.poster.avif?t=1741555589\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2897260/extras/78a5d377e5d6a491ca8dd6374fb40253.webm?t=1741555589\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2897260/extras/78a5d377e5d6a491ca8dd6374fb40253.mp4?t=1741555589\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2897260/extras/43a0fc1a4da826cdf45bc3d156ea8527.poster.avif?t=1741555589\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2897260/extras/43a0fc1a4da826cdf45bc3d156ea8527.webm?t=1741555589\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2897260/extras/43a0fc1a4da826cdf45bc3d156ea8527.mp4?t=1741555589\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Evolve and Conquer</strong><br>Survival is just the beginning. Thrive in adversity by upgrading your wizard with a plethora of skills and abilities. Earn gold and experience from your fallen foes, unlock potent spells, and invest in game-changing upgrades. Every choice shapes your journey and your arsenal.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2897260/extras/ae9dacd166c996c85dd8e5724e078690.poster.avif?t=1741555589\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2897260/extras/ae9dacd166c996c85dd8e5724e078690.webm?t=1741555589\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2897260/extras/ae9dacd166c996c85dd8e5724e078690.mp4?t=1741555589\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Epic Boss Fights</strong><br>The path to salvation is guarded by formidable foes. Bosses of unimaginable power await at the end of key battles, scaling with your strength to offer a challenge worthy of legend. Triumph against these titans for rewards that could turn the tide of war.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Join the Adventure!</h2>Paradise Defense Force is more than a game; it's a call to arms for those brave enough to reclaim a world on the brink. Will you answer the call? Will you be the beacon of hope in a land shrouded in darkness? Dive in and defend the Isles with all your might!",
